{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Any Counter 是一款專注於單一功能的智能計數器，適合需要快速記錄任何數據、而不希望被複雜介面或廣告打擾的使用者。這款 App 現正限時免費下載，讓你無需註冊帳號即可輕鬆上手。</p>\n\n<h2>手勢操作無限計數</h2>\n<p>這款 App 採用直覺的手勢控制，輕觸數字向上滑動即可增加，向下滑動則減少，左右滑動可切換不同項目。每個計數器獨立存在，用戶可自定義名稱與顏色，並隨意增刪排序。無論是用來統計鳥類數量、計算步數還是記錄儲蓄金額，它都能在無網路連線且零隱私風險的情況下，提供極致流暢且無干擾的計數體驗，讓使用者能全心聚焦於當下正在計算的事物。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-114-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-115-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-116-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-117-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-118-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Any Counter: Endless Counter</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T14:28:48.038420+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}